(7237531, 1121255, 38921, '<td valign="top">Wonderful entry, looks like smoke.  Hopefully the voters are smart to know otherwise.</td>', 'Wonderful entry, looks like smoke.  Hopefully the voters are smart to know otherwise.', '2014-07-07 01:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237532, 1121494, 67237, '<td valign="top">nice composition and textures  here!!</td>', 'nice composition and textures  here!!', '2014-07-07 01:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237540, 1121408, 1686, '<td valign="top">Fantastic wave</td>', 'Fantastic wave', '2014-07-07 01:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237558, 1121687, 6519, '<td valign="top">Yes, this is cliche and overdone, but it is really well done and as such I am giving you my top pick (9).<br/>As far as I know, this could be your very first attempt at this type of shot, and you just spent 6 hours straight on it. Just because it has been done before, doesn''t have to mean it has been done by YOU before, and you did very well.<br/>The moment, the lighting and the focus are spot on!</td>', 'Yes, this is cliche and overdone, but it is really well done and as such I am giving you my top pick (9).As far as I know, this could be your very first attempt at this type of shot, and you just spent 6 hours straight on it. Just because it has been done before, doesn''t have to mean it has been done by YOU before, and you did very well.The moment, the lighting and the focus are spot on!', '2014-07-07 03:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237559, 1121384, 6519, '<td valign="top">Yes, this has been done a bunch of times before, but maybe not by YOU. I love the composition and the movement/angle is beautiful, the only thing I am not crazy about is the slight pink background. If you''re going for a stock photo type shot, MEAN IT. 8</td>', 'Yes, this has been done a bunch of times before, but maybe not by YOU. I love the composition and the movement/angle is beautiful, the only thing I am not crazy about is the slight pink background. If you''re going for a stock photo type shot, MEAN IT. 8', '2014-07-07 03:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237560, 1121622, 6519, '<td valign="top">So cute! Unlike many of the other shots that are lovely in many ways but totally lack a real subject, you sure nailed the subjects!!!! The lean to the left bothers me, I wish it had been skewed/straightened, but I am loving the subjects! 8</td>', 'So cute! Unlike many of the other shots that are lovely in many ways but totally lack a real subject, you sure nailed the subjects!!!! The lean to the left bothers me, I wish it had been skewed/straightened, but I am loving the subjects! 8', '2014-07-07 03:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237561, 1121743, 6519, '<td valign="top">Such a simple shot, and yet you have me mesmerized by all the shapes and colours going on inside that glass. Nice focus, nice moment. 8</td>', 'Such a simple shot, and yet you have me mesmerized by all the shapes and colours going on inside that glass. Nice focus, nice moment. 8', '2014-07-07 03:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237562, 1121512, 6519, '<td valign="top">Fabulous action happening here! Almost a little TOO busy, but so very much on challenge. Nice focus on what you needed to be for this challenge.</td>', 'Fabulous action happening here! Almost a little TOO busy, but so very much on challenge. Nice focus on what you needed to be for this challenge.', '2014-07-07 03:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237563, 1121720, 6519, '<td valign="top">A very cliché shot, but lovely composition, nice colours and shapes, and a clean background. 7</td>', 'A very cliché shot, but lovely composition, nice colours and shapes, and a clean background. 7', '2014-07-07 03:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237564, 1121418, 6519, '<td valign="top">I''m loving the compositon, the diagonal, the great focus and the shallow DOF. 7</td>', 'I''m loving the compositon, the diagonal, the great focus and the shallow DOF. 7', '2014-07-07 03:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237565, 1121714, 6519, '<td valign="top">The lighting and contrast are very harsh, but what a great moment!</td>', 'The lighting and contrast are very harsh, but what a great moment!', '2014-07-07 03:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237566, 1121205, 6519, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of how dark this is overall, but wow....... the shape and movement are awesome !!!! 7</td>', 'I''m not a fan of how dark this is overall, but wow....... the shape and movement are awesome !!!! 7', '2014-07-07 03:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237567, 1121578, 6519, '<td valign="top">Cliché, but beautifully done. 7</td>', 'Cliché, but beautifully done. 7', '2014-07-07 03:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237568, 1121659, 6519, '<td valign="top">I have seen this very shot so many times before, but I''m still giving you the benefit of the doubt. After all, this could be your very first attempt at this, and you deserve the pat on the back for that. 7</td>', 'I have seen this very shot so many times before, but I''m still giving you the benefit of the doubt. After all, this could be your very first attempt at this, and you deserve the pat on the back for that. 7', '2014-07-07 03:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237569, 1121583, 6519, '<td valign="top">Not the most exciting scene this spoiled brat might hope for, but I do appreciate your efforts. The low POV combined with the lovely rock/moss/leaf in the foreground keep me happy enough looking at it. 7</td>', 'Not the most exciting scene this spoiled brat might hope for, but I do appreciate your efforts. The low POV combined with the lovely rock/moss/leaf in the foreground keep me happy enough looking at it. 7', '2014-07-07 03:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237570, 1121715, 6519, '<td valign="top">There are other shots like this one in this challenge, but I think yours is the clearest/cleanest of them.</td>', 'There are other shots like this one in this challenge, but I think yours is the clearest/cleanest of them.', '2014-07-07 03:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237571, 1120829, 6519, '<td valign="top">Yes, I can see the "liquid in motion", but I can''t figure out what I''m supposed to be looking at - the foreground, the sticks/masts, clouds, droplets, sky/clouds?</td>', 'Yes, I can see the "liquid in motion", but I can''t figure out what I''m supposed to be looking at - the foreground, the sticks/masts, clouds, droplets, sky/clouds?', '2014-07-07 03:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237572, 1120904, 6519, '<td valign="top">The colours are lovely (although overcooked), the clouds were probably pretty awesome in real life. And yet, I have no clue what I''m supposed to be looking at. I certainly need a LOT of imagination to see "liquid in motion" even if it IS right there in front of me.<br/> <br/>P.S. crooked horizons are a "no no"!</td>', 'The colours are lovely (although overcooked), the clouds were probably pretty awesome in real life. And yet, I have no clue what I''m supposed to be looking at. I certainly need a LOT of imagination to see "liquid in motion" even if it IS right there in front of me. P.S. crooked horizons are a "no no"!', '2014-07-07 03:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237573, 1121547, 6519, '<td valign="top">Yes, I can see "liquid in motion", but I see a VERY busy shot in B&amp;W, and I really don''t know what the subject is. <br/>My eyes keep trying to settle on a leaf near the top, only to be distracted by bright circles elsewhere.</td>', 'Yes, I can see "liquid in motion", but I see a VERY busy shot in B&W, and I really don''t know what the subject is. My eyes keep trying to settle on a leaf near the top, only to be distracted by bright circles elsewhere.', '2014-07-07 03:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237574, 1121627, 6519, '<td valign="top">Your very central composition works due to the very symmetrical scene.<br/> <br/>Sorry, but I find the colours/contrast/processing very harsh and hard to look at.</td>', 'Your very central composition works due to the very symmetrical scene. Sorry, but I find the colours/contrast/processing very harsh and hard to look at.', '2014-07-07 03:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237575, 1121626, 6519, '<td valign="top">In principle, this is a good idea for a subject.<br/> <br/>However, I don''t like the boring centered and straight composition, and the way you used your body to create partial shade.</td>', 'In principle, this is a good idea for a subject. However, I don''t like the boring centered and straight composition, and the way you used your body to create partial shade.', '2014-07-07 03:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237576, 1121217, 6519, '<td valign="top">Yes, I can see "liquid in motion", but this scene is not very exciting. It doesn''t help that the waterfall leans down on the right.<br/>If you can, you might like to go back and experiment with different angles.... creating diagonals, leading lines, etc might make for a more interesting composition.</td>', 'Yes, I can see "liquid in motion", but this scene is not very exciting. It doesn''t help that the waterfall leans down on the right.If you can, you might like to go back and experiment with different angles.... creating diagonals, leading lines, etc might make for a more interesting composition.', '2014-07-07 03:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237577, 1121281, 6519, '<td valign="top">I''m not a really big fan of HDR, but you did ok with it.<br/>However, I''m not too crazy about the composition. It is neither dead centre, nor is it at an angle that might create visual interest, leading lines, or adhere to the rule of thirds or other compositional rules.<br/> <br/>I certainly DO get the feeling of "liquid in motion", though.</td>', 'I''m not a really big fan of HDR, but you did ok with it.However, I''m not too crazy about the composition. It is neither dead centre, nor is it at an angle that might create visual interest, leading lines, or adhere to the rule of thirds or other compositional rules. I certainly DO get the feeling of "liquid in motion", though.', '2014-07-07 04:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237578, 1120993, 6519, '<td valign="top">Very "impressionist" in style, and it works for me in this case. You have a near diagonal which is way better than just a straight line, I like the colours and I most certainly get a sense of "liquid in motion".</td>', 'Very "impressionist" in style, and it works for me in this case. You have a near diagonal which is way better than just a straight line, I like the colours and I most certainly get a sense of "liquid in motion".', '2014-07-07 04:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237579, 1121424, 6519, '<td valign="top">Yes, I see "liquid in motion", but I find the processing on this very busy scene a bit harsh and difficult to look at.</td>', 'Yes, I see "liquid in motion", but I find the processing on this very busy scene a bit harsh and difficult to look at.', '2014-07-07 04:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237580, 1121685, 6519, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.... I agree, that river is very likely "liquid in motion" and yet that is not what comes to MY mind when looking at that scene (plus I''m not crazy about the processing, sorry).</td>', 'Hmmm.... I agree, that river is very likely "liquid in motion" and yet that is not what comes to MY mind when looking at that scene (plus I''m not crazy about the processing, sorry).', '2014-07-07 04:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237581, 1121449, 6519, '<td valign="top">What is the subject here? I assume that is the photographer''s shadow... is that it?</td>', 'What is the subject here? I assume that is the photographer''s shadow... is that it?', '2014-07-07 04:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237582, 1121716, 6519, '<td valign="top">Good try and I do see "liquid in motion".<br/>I find the crop at the top a little odd, and the whole image is a bit murky and lacklustre.</td>', 'Good try and I do see "liquid in motion".I find the crop at the top a little odd, and the whole image is a bit murky and lacklustre.', '2014-07-07 04:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237583, 1121751, 6519, '<td valign="top">I''m having a hard time concentrating on "liquid in motion" when I am seeing so many different shapes and bright colours.</td>', 'I''m having a hard time concentrating on "liquid in motion" when I am seeing so many different shapes and bright colours.', '2014-07-07 04:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237584, 1121286, 6519, '<td valign="top">My eyes keep trying - but failing - to spot something that is actually in focus.</td>', 'My eyes keep trying - but failing - to spot something that is actually in focus.', '2014-07-07 04:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
