(7237587, 1121682, 6519, '<td valign="top">There is no subject at all, nothing to grab my interest.</td>', 'There is no subject at all, nothing to grab my interest.', '2014-07-07 04:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237588, 1121731, 6519, '<td valign="top">With a LOT of imagination, I might be able to see the connection to "liquid in motion", but it is a bit too chaotic for me to even try, sorry.</td>', 'With a LOT of imagination, I might be able to see the connection to "liquid in motion", but it is a bit too chaotic for me to even try, sorry.', '2014-07-07 04:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237589, 1121581, 6519, '<td valign="top">I prefer shots like this one when there is more in focus and maybe not quite as noisy and murky.</td>', 'I prefer shots like this one when there is more in focus and maybe not quite as noisy and murky.', '2014-07-07 04:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237590, 1121748, 6519, '<td valign="top">This desperately needs an actual subject.... a boat, a whale, a fish, even just a little rubber ducky..... SOMETHING to actually look at.</td>', 'This desperately needs an actual subject.... a boat, a whale, a fish, even just a little rubber ducky..... SOMETHING to actually look at.', '2014-07-07 04:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237591, 1121232, 6519, '<td valign="top">This could be a VERY still body of water, but I''ll try to imagine the motion in it. However, now I am still left with a grey/blue/drab image with a static composition. Interesting texture over the top, though... I didn''t even know that was legal in advanced editing  :-)</td>', 'This could be a VERY still body of water, but I''ll try to imagine the motion in it. However, now I am still left with a grey/blue/drab image with a static composition. Interesting texture over the top, though... I didn''t even know that was legal in advanced editing  :-)', '2014-07-07 04:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
